# 9front's off-topic files, left out of the distribution (tools/dist):
# its jokes and quotation collections, and the scripts that only print
# them.  No program needs them.  Games stay.  Regular expressions on a
# file's path in the distribution.
^/lib/(bullshit|theo|troll|rob|ken|rsc|uriel|dougfacts|glass|greg|roa|faust|strangelove|constitution|gettysburg|1oct1993|human|plentyofroom|mammals|volcanoes)$
^/lib/1oct1993/
^/rc/bin/(bullshit|theo|troll|nietzsche)$
^/sys/games/lib/fortunes$
